{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice with the Devil: Rerolled is a deckbuilder autobattler about scoring the best out of three dice rolls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win souls from your opponents and design your hand of three dice to out-luck your opponents and advance through the areas of the casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/dd3bad4bbc14fa9380146cb8f0a46f95.avif?t=1744389049\" width=609 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOT A ROGUELIKE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing battles only loses the souls you wager, so don't be afraid to experiment and try new strategies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/cbe20c9069f6419635bcfc44a66a42de.avif?t=1744389049\" width=609 height=87 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/3d55e17f56c4e7371e6a4b2bb73d7b6c.poster.avif?t=1744389049\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/3d55e17f56c4e7371e6a4b2bb73d7b6c.webm?t=1744389049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/3d55e17f56c4e7371e6a4b2bb73d7b6c.mp4?t=1744389049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete fun challenges to unlock new dice</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From drawing with your opponent, to rolling over 100 with three dice, overcoming them is key to success! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/54cfc24d1cf974143830869c3e4d8e69.avif?t=1744389049\" width=609 height=87 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/aeed559fd0a7629e252376bd3a7e83a3.poster.avif?t=1744389049\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/aeed559fd0a7629e252376bd3a7e83a3.webm?t=1744389049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/aeed559fd0a7629e252376bd3a7e83a3.mp4?t=1744389049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy dice for your hand and customise them with stickers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickers add new abilities to dice that enhance your roll and help you win.<br>With thousands of possible combinations, you control if luck will be on your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/16e39f8bfdddb067576e8263ba79fa1c.avif?t=1744389049\" width=609 height=87 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/22f46b3f88032df98dc845036e416b7f.poster.avif?t=1744389049\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/22f46b3f88032df98dc845036e416b7f.webm?t=1744389049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972600/extras/22f46b3f88032df98dc845036e416b7f.mp4?t=1744389049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_parag